Description: Research code for the counterfactual-text laboratory,
    Can Words Move Inflation Expectations? The inherited version 2.0.0
    inputs retain their historical GPT-5.5 release identity. Prospective
    Terra 5.6 code uses a separately fingerprinted artifact run and a
    frozen-calibration Focus agreement diagnostic. New collection,
    numerical reference acceptance, and clean-room validation are pending.
